  "$metrosComment": [
    "Metro areas, defined as explicit airport lists because they do not map onto state boundaries.",
    "",
    "These also fix a real resolution failure. Free-text search on a short query like 'LA' does a",
    "substring match and returns AtLanta, DalLas and OrLando before it returns LAX. Colloquial",
    "metro names are common in real questions ('compare LA and Santa Ana'), so they are resolved",
    "from this table rather than guessed at.",
    "",
    "A metro deliberately resolves to MULTIPLE airports so the agent asks which one the user meant",
    "instead of silently picking the biggest."
  ],
  "metros": [
    {
      "id": "los_angeles",
      "label": "Los Angeles area",
